    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568930/extras/4f93f26749672b0ef6b0c0c962ed041c.avif?t=1747090383\" data-has-big width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</i>The story of Hexagon Experiments is set on the planet Erythra, where 1k1 Corporation conducts experimental research. During one of these experiments, a test vehicle returning to Earth malfunctions and crashes into a settlement. A bacterium, brought to Earth for study, is released in the accident, infecting those investigating the crash site and triggering a spreading infection. The outbreak escalates to a global scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Within 1k1 Corporation, two subsidiaries\u20141k1 Industries and 1k1 Genesis\u2014develop the Zethrion 9 human prototype. To combat the pandemic, a cure must be developed on Erythra. A 300-day deadline is set to create the vaccine. During this period, Zethrion 9 operates in a central lab on Erythra, surrounded by greenhouses. Zethrion 9 is tasked with cultivating plants in these greenhouses to develop the cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Additionally, an unexpected challenge arises: a shield covering a specific area deactivates at night due to power imbalances. When night falls, Zethrion 9 must defend the lab and plants from creatures roaming the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568930/extras/b46095cdeaeb80fb18f4baaadb12a666.avif?t=1747090383\" width=602 height=906 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568930/extras/4f93f26749672b0ef6b0c0c962ed041c.avif?t=1747090383\" data-has-big width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</i>The story of Hexagon Experiments is set on the planet Erythra, where 1k1 Corporation conducts experimental research. During one of these experiments, a test vehicle returning to Earth malfunctions and crashes into a settlement. A bacterium, brought to Earth for study, is released in the accident, infecting those investigating the crash site and triggering a spreading infection. The outbreak escalates to a global scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Within 1k1 Corporation, two subsidiaries\u20141k1 Industries and 1k1 Genesis\u2014develop the Zethrion 9 human prototype. To combat the pandemic, a cure must be developed on Erythra. A 300-day deadline is set to create the vaccine. During this period, Zethrion 9 operates in a central lab on Erythra, surrounded by greenhouses. Zethrion 9 is tasked with cultivating plants in these greenhouses to develop the cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Additionally, an unexpected challenge arises: a shield covering a specific area deactivates at night due to power imbalances. When night falls, Zethrion 9 must defend the lab and plants from creatures roaming the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568930/extras/b46095cdeaeb80fb18f4baaadb12a666.avif?t=1747090383\" width=602 height=906 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
